      <title>第二章：遗留系统</title>
      <link>https://pengjiyuan.github.io/novel/%E9%81%97%E7%95%99%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 06 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
